<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">

<head>

  <meta charset="UTF-8">

  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Clue 23 | Ina Mystery Clue Game</title>

  <style>

    body {

      margin: 0;

      padding: 30px 20px;

      background-color: #111111;

      color: #f5f5f5;

      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;

      text-align: center;

    }

    .clue-card {

      max-width: 650px;

      margin: 40px auto;

      padding: 35px 25px;

      background-color: #1c1c1c;

      border: 3px solid #b71c1c;

      border-radius: 12px;

      box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(183, 28, 28, 0.35);

    }

    h1 {

      color: #d32f2f;

      font-size: 2.2rem;

      margin-bottom: 10px;

      letter-spacing: 2px;

    }

    h2 {

      color: #ffffff;

      font-size: 1.5rem;

      margin-bottom: 30px;

    }

    p {

      font-size: 1.2rem;

      line-height: 1.7;

    }

    .note {

      margin: 30px 0;

      padding: 20px;

      background-color: #eeeeee;

      color: #111111;

      font-style: italic;

      border-radius: 5px;

      transform: rotate(-1deg);

    }

    .detective-note {

      margin-top: 30px;

      padding: 20px;

      border-top: 1px solid #777777;

      border-bottom: 1px solid #777777;

    }

    .keep-going {

      margin-top: 30px;

      color: #d32f2f;

      font-size: 1.4rem;

      font-weight: bold;

    }

    .footer {

      margin-top: 35px;

      font-size: 0.9rem;

      color: #aaaaaa;

    }

  </style>

</head>

<body>

  <div class="clue-card">

    <h1>🔎 CLUE 23</h1>

    <h2>THE FORGOTTEN NOTE</h2>

    <p>

      A crumpled note was discovered where no one thought to look.

    </p>

    <div class="note">

      “I saw someone leave the room… but I couldn't see their face.”

    </div>

    <p>

      The witness remembers only one thing:

    </p>

    <p>

      <strong>They seemed to be in a hurry.</strong>

    </p>

    <p>

      Was someone fleeing the scene?

    </p>

    <p>

      Or were they simply in the wrong place at the wrong time?

    </p>

    <div class="detective-note">

      <strong>🕵️ DETECTIVE'S NOTE</strong>

      <p>

        Not every suspicious action makes someone guilty.

      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="keep-going">

      KEEP INVESTIGATING...

    </div>

    <div class="footer">

      Bisbee Breakfast Club • Ina Mystery

    </div>

  </div>

</body>

</html>
